    <Description>For this macro to work you will need to get rid of hasty bees and get the second hive on the right, the stand on the very front edge of the white circle on your hive and enable shiftlock, zoom all the way in and centre your camera directly fowards the press start and keep shiftlock on the whole time.       Let me know if there is any bugs and ill release an updated version :)</Description>
